    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Кварти́ра больша́я?","gloss":"Is the flat big?"},{"by":"b","text":"Нет, ма́ленькая. Одна́ ко́мната.","gloss":"No, small. One room."},{"by":"a","text":"А стол есть?","gloss":"And is there a table?"},{"by":"b","text":"Есть, ма́ленький. Нет большо́го стола́.","gloss":"Yes, a small one. There's no big table."},{"by":"a","text":"Ты там одна́?","gloss":"Are you there on your own?"},{"by":"b","text":"Нет, я с но́вой кни́гой!","gloss":"No, I'm with a new book!"}] practice true size 1.6 hidden true
    text pk1 "нет большо́го стола́" say "нет большо́го стола́" colors {"ого$":"#1a8a8a","а$":"#1a8a8a"} x 500 y 390 font_size 60 hidden true

A: How do you say in a big house in Russian, or with a new book?
    draw masha masha_name building

A: In lesson twelve, big came in its plain form: Э́то большо́й дом.
    draw ref12

A: Today it goes into the cases.
    highlight ref12 color #8f887c part большо́й effect underline

    erase ref12

A: Masha has moved, and I'm phoning her: listen first, with no words on the screen.
    draw tom tom_name

A: Ма́ша, где ты живёшь сейча́с?
    draw phone caption false

B: Я живу́ в но́вой кварти́ре, в большо́м до́ме.
    draw phone_m caption false

    ask "Where does Masha live now?" voice b options ["in an old flat, in a big building","in a new flat, in a big building","in a small flat, in a big building"] correct 2
        gloss: I live in a new flat, in a big building.
        listen: Я живу́ в но́вой кварти́ре, в большо́м до́ме.
        right: In a new flat, in a big building.
        wrong: Listen again for what Masha says about the flat.
    voice a

    erase building

    hide tom tom_name phone phone_m masha masha_name

A: Кварти́ра is new: a flat. And a дом is any building people live in, a block of flats too.
    draw s1a s1b

A: До́ме you know from lesson nine: в до́ме, with the place е.
    highlight s1b_w_3 color #d0865f part е$

A: But big moves too: not большо́й, but большо́м. The adjective has its own place ending, ом.
    highlight s1b_w_2 color #d0865f part ом$

A: You've said that ом before, in lesson fifty-three: пя́тый became пя́том, в два́дцать пя́том году́.
    draw ref53

    erase ref53

A: A she-word does it with ой: кварти́ра, в кварти́ре, and но́вая, в но́вой кварти́ре.
    highlight s1a_w_4 color #d0865f part ой$

    erase s1a s1b

B: В большо́м до́ме. В большо́й кварти́ре.
    draw h_he h_she r1h r1s

A: Yes, большо́й again: next to a she-word it's the place form, and кварти́ре gives it away.
    highlight r1s color #8f887c part большо́й effect underline

B: С но́вым дру́гом. С но́вой кни́гой.
    draw r2h r2s

A: After с, the with-ending of lesson thirty-six: the noun says ом or ой, and new says ым or ой.
    highlight r2h r2s color #2f6b8f

B: Нет большо́го стола́.
    draw r3h

A: After нет comes the of-ending: стола́, and big says большо́го. The г sounds like в, as in кого́.
    highlight r3h color #1a8a8a part ого$

A: Ко́мната is new: a room. Нет большо́й ко́мнаты.
    draw r3s

A: Now read down the she side: ой, ой, ой. With a she-word, big and new mostly say ой in all three.
    highlight r1s r2s r3s color #3d3833 part ой$ effect underline

A: The he side has three: ом for a place, after в; ым after с; and ого after нет.
    highlight r1h r2h r3h color #3d3833 effect underline

    hide board

A: I have more questions. Listen, and then you can practise it.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

A: Did you hear them? С но́вой кни́гой, with ой on both words.
    text pk2 "с но́вой кни́гой" say "с но́вой кни́гой" colors {"ой$":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 520 font_size 60

A: And нет большо́го стола́, with ого.
    draw pk1

    erase pk1 pk2

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    icon q_house size 180 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["house","house with garden"] icon_look picture of "office building"

    quiz "Ivan lives in a big house. Ива́н живёт в ___ до́ме. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Ива́н живёт в большо́м до́ме." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Большо́м: a he-word, and a place, so ом.
        wrong: Where is he? With a he-word, the place ending is ом.
        * большо́й
        + большо́м
        * большо́го

    erase q_house

    icon q_book size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["book","books"] icon_look picture of "closed book"

    quiz "Masha says she's with a new book. Я с ___ кни́гой. Which is right?" reveal.text "Я с но́вой кни́гой." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Но́вой: кни́га is a she-word, so ой, like кни́гой.
        wrong: Кни́га is a she-word. What did the she side say every time?
        + но́вой
        * но́вым
        * но́вая

    erase q_book

    icon q_room size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["couch and lamp","house"] icon_look picture of bed

    quiz "Masha's flat has one small room. There's no big room: which is right?" reveal.text "Нет большо́й ко́мнаты." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: After нет both words change: big says ой, and the room says ы.
        wrong: After нет, both words change. What does big say next to a she-word?
        * Нет большо́го ко́мнаты.
        * Нет большо́й ко́мната.
        + Нет большо́й ко́мнаты.

    erase q_room

    icon q_tom size 130 set twemoji x 860 y 420 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man
    text q_tomq "А стол есть?" say "А стол есть?" x 860 y 560 font_size 44
    icon q_masha size 130 set twemoji x 140 y 420 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman

    ask "I ask if there's a table. Answer like Masha: there's no big table." say_it "Нет большо́го стола́." gloss "There's no big table." voice b show cue test t1
    voice a

    erase q_tom q_tomq

B: Нет большо́го стола́. Есть ма́ленький.
    text q_say "Нет большо́го стола́." say "Нет большо́го стола́." colors {"ого$":"#1a8a8a","а$":"#1a8a8a"} x 540 y 300 font_size 64

    erase q_masha q_say

    icon q_key size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["old key","house"] icon_look picture of key

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I live in a new flat." answer ["я живу в новой квартире","живу в новой квартире"] reveal.text "Я живу́ в но́вой кварти́ре." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я живу́ в но́вой кварти́ре: ой on new, and е on the flat.
        wrong: Start with я живу́ в, then new and flat, both in the place form.

    erase q_key

    icon score_woman size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_woman

    show board

A: So when a noun goes into a case, its adjective goes too: в большо́м до́ме, с но́вой кни́гой, нет большо́го стола́; and next to a she-word, it's mostly ой.
    highlight r1h r2s r3h color #3d3833 effect underline

    erase board

B: Я в но́вой кварти́ре, с но́вой кни́гой! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_book size 150 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["book","books"] icon_look picture of "closed book"
    text end_say "Я в но́вой кварти́ре, с но́вой кни́гой!" say "Я в но́вой кварти́ре, с но́вой кни́гой!" x 500 y 290 font_size 46

    erase end_masha end_book end_say

A: Next time: моему́ бра́ту, to my brother: my and your in the cases.
